internal/gamesounds/files/*.mp3
    The 26 item filter alert sounds of Path of Exile 2. These are the game's
    own audio assets and belong to Grinding Gear Games. They are included so
    that a player can hear which alert sound a rule is about to use, before
    putting that rule in their filter. The application never plays them during
    play: the generated filter contains PlayAlertSound, and in game the game
    plays its own audio.

frontend/public/craft/data/*
    Modifier pools, weights and tiers, essence and currency rules for the
    supported item classes, taken from poe2db.tw (see
    frontend/public/craft/data/manifest.json for the exact pages and when
    they were fetched) and reduced by build/craft/build_data.py. poe2db.tw
    publishes this data under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/); these files are
    shared under the same licence, not under the MIT licence of the code (see
    frontend/public/craft/data/LICENSE.txt). The underlying game data belongs
    to Grinding Gear Games; the compilation is poe2db.tw's.

    Two files there come from elsewhere: bases.json (base item defences,
    weapon numbers and requirements) is built from RePoE's base_items
    (https://repoe-fork.github.io/poe2/), and the spawn weights of the rune
    modifier pools (Marksman, Decay, Berserking, Chronomancy, Soul,
    Destruction; build/craft/special-weights.json) are taken from Craft of
    Exile (https://www.craftofexile.com). Those weights were measured by
    Krakenbul and the Prohibited Library Discord; the credit is theirs.

internal/overlay/data/runeshape.json
    Expedition's Runeshape Combinations recipes (each reward, its count and
    the runes that make it), taken from
    https://poe2db.tw/us/Runeshape_Combinations and reduced by
    build/expedition/build_recipes.py; the file records when it was built.
    poe2db.tw publishes this data under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/); the file is shared
    under the same licence, not under the MIT licence of the code. The
    underlying game data belongs to Grinding Gear Games; the compilation is
    poe2db.tw's.

